			dependencies: ["331DDF60E6FD9C80"]
			description: [
				"The Stove is the centre piece of the kitchen, it is used to cook many different dishes in this world. Careful however as it's surface is hot and can burn you. Much like the campfire, it doesn't require any fuel to stay alight."
				""
				"Placing a cooking pot, skillet, kettle or copper pot on top will let you start your journey into the nearly endless depths of ingredients you can discover in the corners of every world available to you."
