		{
			description: [
				"Seeds are the cornerstone of farming, use them to grow new crops and discover both functional, and delicious ways of using them."
				""
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				"An important thing to note is the Seasons! &6Create - Forge Frontier&r uses the mod Serene Seasons. These seasons can be seen on your HUD or through the Calendar item. "
				""
				"The season affects crop growth, each crop has the best fertile season for them as shown in their tooltip! If you want to grow crops out of season they will grow much slower, though there are some ways of improving this:"
				""
				"1. Underground farms (Below y = 48) with no exposure to the open sky."
				""
				"2. Bees will still pollinate crops regardless of season"
				""
				"3. Building a roof of Glass or Stained Glass a maximum of 16 blocks above the crops, like a sort of greenhouse. "
			]
			icon: {
				Count: 1
				id: "minecraft:wheat_seeds"
				tag: { }
			}
			id: "0A00F834972CF915"
