		}
		{
			dependencies: ["1E2F74C7110CFEB3"]
			description: [
				"The Skillet needs to be placed on top of a Campfire, Stove, Magma Block or Blaze Burner. These heat sources will let you cook any recipe that the Campfire allows, but faster. "
				""
				"The skillet can also be enchanted, fire aspect shortens cooking time. Other potential enchantments that can be infused, are the same list as those of a Sword. "
				""
				"A blaze burner will passively heat the skillet and does not need to be fed any fuel."
