		{
			dependencies: ["0A00F834972CF915"]
			description: [
				"Rich Soil can be used as a replacement for Dirt, it comes with the benefits of both &cRed&r and &eYellow&r Fertilizer built in. It also interacts in special ways with mushrooms, allowing them to grow into larger Mushroom colonies"
				""
				"To accelerate it's creation you can either use Create to mix all the requirements together, or place your organic compost in direct sunlight, adjacent to water or close to mushrooms, podzol, or existing rich soil blocks. All of these can accelerate the in world formation of rich soil from compost."
				" "
			]
